  "title": {
   "en": "Overtime Elite"
  },
  "description": {
   "en": "Omari’s dream was always to become a professional basketball player.\nBut that dream was quickly crushed by reality.\nThere’s school, money, his strict aunt, and the future, of which he wasn’t sure of until a mysterious scout discovers his talent with a ball and offers him a ticket to Overtime Elite Academy, a high-tech program designed to craft the world's greatest basketball player.\nDoes Omari have what it takes to survive against the most competitive basketball talent?\nOr will his dream slip away again?\n\n(Source: Webtoon)",
   "pt-br": "Omari sonhava em ser jogador de basquete profissional, mas a realidade parecia impossibilitar isso. Até que um olheiro descobre seu talento e o convida para a Overtime Elite Academy, um programa de elite para criar os melhores jogadores do mundo. Agora, Omari precisa provar que tem o que é preciso para competir com os melhores e realizar seu sonho."
  },
